# 評分紀錄：只公開兩組主要對比、prompt v2 的跑次和校準報告（評審者為 claude 與 LLM 評審）
runs/*
!runs/20261009-101326_deepseek-flash/
!runs/20261009-101342_qwen3.8-max/
!runs/20261009-164051_deepseek-flash_prompt-v2/
!runs/calibration/
!runs/20261016-000125_deepseek-flash_plain-account.en.deepseek-flash_kbvsrag-kb/
!runs/20261016-000341_deepseek-flash_plain-account.en.deepseek-flash_kbvsrag-rag/
!runs/20261016-005426_deepseek-flash_plain-account-pdf.en.deepseek-flash_kbvsrag-kbpdf/
!runs/20261016-005426_deepseek-flash_plain-account-pdf.en.deepseek-flash_kbvsrag-hybrid/
runs/*/*.bak
runs/calibration/*.key.json
# 牧者與其他真人評分不公開，只留 claude 和 LLM 評審
runs/*/human/*
!runs/*/human/claude.jsonl
!runs/*/human/judge-*.jsonl

# 線上評分：牧者代碼、伺服器資料、打包檔、舊版備份
human_scoring/assignment.json
human_scoring/_backup_原版/
human_scoring/deploy/*.tar.gz

# data pulled from the VPS: users' private questions and ratings, never committed
